<title>GERMANY: Continental adds Duesseldorf, Frankfurt services.</title>
<headline>Continental adds Duesseldorf, Frankfurt services.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc. said it will launch a daily New York Newark to Duesseldorf service on March 20.</p>
<p>The new flight will be operated by using a 238-seat DC-10-30 aircraft.</p>
<p>Continental will also add a second daily flight between Newark and Frankfurt from July 1 to August 31 for the summer holiday season.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
